    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Order alert: new order → sheet + Telegram\nReceives an order, blocks duplicates, then logs it to Google Sheets and alerts the owner on Telegram.\n\n**Flow:** Webhook → Edit Fields → Check Duplicates → If → Log + Telegram\n\n**Key idea:** every order carries an `Order_ID`. The workflow looks that ID up in the sheet first. Found = stop. Not found = log it and send the alert.\n\n**Known limit:** two identical requests arriving at the exact same moment could both pass the check.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 1190,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -768,
        -752
      ],
      "id": "36ae0611-d71c-4b2e-b44b-37ceafb98592",
      "name": "Sticky Note Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 · Receive and clean\n**Webhook** takes a POST request. The order details arrive as query parameters: `Name`, `Address`, `Order`, `Order_ID`.\n\n**Edit Fields** keeps only those four and names them cleanly for the next nodes.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 430,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -752,
        -400
      ],
      "id": "6af8e55b-f8fc-4e79-8271-2ab42aa71fad",
      "name": "Sticky Note Receive"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 · Check for duplicates\n**Check Duplicates** searches the sheet for this `Order_ID`. *Always Output Data* is on, so the flow still continues when nothing is found.\n\n**If** compares the sheet's ID with the incoming one:\n- Match (true): already logged, the flow stops.\n- No match (false): new order, continue.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -304,
        -400
      ],
      "id": "3f5d8377-15aa-419c-8be5-99569ad1f0bf",
      "name": "Sticky Note Duplicates"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 · Log and notify\nOnly new orders reach this stage.\n\n**Log Order Details to Sheets** adds the row (matched on ID).\n\n**Send Order Details to Telegram** messages the owner with name, address, order and ID.",
        "height": 580,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        128,
        -432
      ],
      "id": "fa1d4ad4-b207-4cc2-9abb-bdefff2e6f1e",
      "name": "Sticky Note Notify"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Test it\nSend the same request twice, then once with a new ID:\n\n`POST <webhook URL>?Name=Dina&Address=Giza&Order=Mizuno 44&Order_ID=1001`\n\n**Expected:** 1 message + 1 row for 1001, nothing new on the repeat, then a new message + row for 1002.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 1190,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -768,
        192
      ],
      "id": "cc8ad4c9-91b8-4b28-9ebc-874be7f204c1",
      "name": "Sticky Note Test"
    }
  ],
